Below is the initial draft aligned with the reference direction.

16-sec Concept (Draft)

0:00–0:05 A worried husband sits on the edge of the bed while his wife notices that something is troubling him.

Dialogue: &quot;अगर आपकी टाइमिंग कम है... और जल्दी वीर्य निकल जाता है...&quot;

0:05–0:10 His embarrassment becomes visible, and his wife reassures him.

Dialogue: &quot;...जिसकी वजह से शर्मिंदगी महसूस होती है...&quot;

0:10–0:16 The wife confidently picks up Saffron Grove, followed by a close-up of the product as she looks at him.

Dialogue: &quot;तो आपके लिए है Saffron Grove...&quot;

This initial 16-second concept follows the winner script and last reference. I am still refining the remaining shots and dialogue.
